{"seq":3,"slug":"restricted-quota-permit-check","title":"限售数量/许可证实时校验（联186）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-market-eligibility-matrix/sellability-gates/restricted-quota-permit-check","wordCount":2447,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"限售数量-许可证实时校验-联186\">限售数量/许可证实时校验（联186）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>绝大多数准入判定是<strong>纯函数</strong>：给定商品属性、市场、资质状态，输出结论，不依赖任何会变化的外部状态。配额型限售是例外——它的判定依赖一个<strong>会被并发修改的计数器</strong>，因此求值不再是纯函数，而是一次带预留语义的资源分配。把它当成普通条件会导致超卖：两个请求在同一时刻都读到「剩余 5 件」，都判定通过，最终卖出 6 件。</p>\n<p>关税配额（Tariff-Rate Quota）是配额型限售最常见的一类法定来源：对同一税则号在配额内适用较低税率、配额外适用较高税率，配额按先到先得或按分配方式管理，因此额度本身成为可售性的硬约束。欧盟 TARIC 编码就是在 8 位 CN 之上承载这类关税措施（含关税配额）的 10 位编码层级（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Combined_Nomenclature\">Combined Nomenclature 与 TARIC</a>）。</p>\n<p>配额型限售有三种典型形态，它们的并发语义不同。<strong>总量配额</strong>（某市场某品类全年限量）是全局单一计数器；<strong>单用户配额</strong>（每人限购 N 件）是按键分片的计数器，冲突面小；<strong>许可证配额</strong>（某张进口许可项下的额度）与许可证实体绑定，可能同时受有效期与余额约束。三者的共同点是都需要「检查 + 扣减」的原子性，不同点是分片键。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配额形态</th>\n<th>分片键</th>\n<th>典型规模</th>\n<th>冲突概率</th>\n<th>超发后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>总量配额</td>\n<td>市场 × 品类 × 周期</td>\n<td>小（数百）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>超出法定/政策上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单主体配额</td>\n<td>买家人 × 商品</td>\n<td>大（百万级）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>同一主体超额购买</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>许可配额</td>\n<td>许可证 × 商品</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>超出许可范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>活动配额</td>\n<td>活动 × 商品</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>极高（秒杀）</td>\n<td>超卖，履约失败</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  R[请求: 购买 qty 件] --&gt; K[构造配额键&lt;br/&gt;market×category×period]&#10;  K --&gt; C{读计数}&#10;  C --&gt;|剩余充足| R1[原子预留 qty&lt;br/&gt;条件更新]&#10;  R1 --&gt;|成功| OK[放行 + 返回预留号]&#10;  R1 --&gt;|失败| RE[重读并重试&lt;br/&gt;有限次数]&#10;  RE --&gt;|仍失败| BL[BLOCK: 配额不足]&#10;  C --&gt;|不足| BL&#10;  OK --&gt; T{结算成功?}&#10;  T --&gt;|是| CM[确认预留&lt;br/&gt;计数落定]&#10;  T --&gt;|否| RB[释放预留&lt;br/&gt;计数回滚]\">graph TD\n  R[请求: 购买 qty 件] --&gt; K[构造配额键&lt;br/&gt;market×category×period]\n  K --&gt; C{读计数}\n  C --&gt;|剩余充足| R1[原子预留 qty&lt;br/&gt;条件更新]\n  R1 --&gt;|成功| OK[放行 + 返回预留号]\n  R1 --&gt;|失败| RE[重读并重试&lt;br/&gt;有限次数]\n  RE --&gt;|仍失败| BL[BLOCK: 配额不足]\n  C --&gt;|不足| BL\n  OK --&gt; T{结算成功?}\n  T --&gt;|是| CM[确认预留&lt;br/&gt;计数落定]\n  T --&gt;|否| RB[释放预留&lt;br/&gt;计数回滚]</pre><h2 id=\"条件更新与预留语义\">条件更新与预留语义</h2><p>实现配额正确性的标准做法是<strong>条件更新（compare-and-set）</strong>：把「校验」与「扣减」合并成一条原子 SQL，由数据库的比较条件保证不会超发。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE quota_counter&#10;   SET used = used + :qty,&#10;       updated_at = now()&#10; WHERE quota_key = :quota_key&#10;   AND period_end &gt;= CURRENT_DATE&#10;   AND used + :qty &lt;= limit_value;&#10;-- 受影响行数 = 1 表示预留成功；= 0 表示配额不足或已过期\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_counter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> used </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> used </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :qty,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :quota_key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> period_end </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> used </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> limit_value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 受影响行数 = 1 表示预留成功；= 0 表示配额不足或已过期</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条语句的关键是 <code>used + :qty &lt;= limit_value</code> 放在 <code>WHERE</code> 而非应用层判断。把它放到应用层就退化成「读-判断-写」，在并发下必然超发。返回受影响行数是判断成功与否的唯一依据。</p>\n<p>但直接扣减 <code>used</code> 会在<strong>订单未结算</strong>时造成永久占用。因此需要预留（reservation）而非直接扣减：扣减产生一条带状态的预留记录，结算成功转 <code>CONFIRMED</code>，失败或超时转 <code>RELEASED</code> 并回补。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE quota_counter (&#10;  quota_key    VARCHAR(160) PRIMARY KEY,  -- market|category|period&#10;  limit_value  BIGINT       NOT NULL,&#10;  used         BIGINT       NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,   -- 含已预留未确认&#10;  period_start DATE         NOT NULL,&#10;  period_end   DATE         NOT NULL,&#10;  version      BIGINT       NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  updated_at   TIMESTAMPTZ  NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE quota_reservation (&#10;  reservation_id BIGINT      PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  quota_key      VARCHAR(160) NOT NULL REFERENCES quota_counter(quota_key),&#10;  order_id       BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  qty            INT         NOT NULL,&#10;  state          VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,   -- HELD/CONFIRMED/RELEASED/EXPIRED&#10;  expires_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  created_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX ix_reservation_expiry ON quota_reservation (state, expires_at);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> quota_counter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  quota_key    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">160</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- market|category|period</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  limit_value  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  used         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 含已预留未确认</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  period_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  period_end   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  updated_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> quota_reservation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reservation_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  quota_key      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">160</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_counter(quota_key),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qty            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- HELD/CONFIRMED/RELEASED/EXPIRED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expires_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ix_reservation_expiry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_reservation (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, expires_at);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>used</code> 的含义是「已预留 + 已确认」，因此 <code>limit_value - used</code> 是可售余量，与订单是否结算无关；结算失败时通过把预留置为 <code>RELEASED</code> 并回补 <code>used</code> 来返还。</p>\n<h3 id=\"过期预留的回收\">过期预留的回收</h3><p>预留必须有超时，否则用户加购后不付款会永久占额。回收机制是一个按 <code>expires_at</code> 扫描的定时任务：把过期且仍为 <code>HELD</code> 的预留置为 <code>EXPIRED</code> 并在同一事务内回补 <code>quota_counter.used</code>。回补必须与置状态在<strong>同一事务</strong>，否则进程崩溃会留下「已释放但未回补」的泄漏，长期导致配额凭空减少。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH expired AS (&#10;  SELECT reservation_id, quota_key, qty&#10;  FROM quota_reservation&#10;  WHERE state = &#39;HELD&#39; AND expires_at &lt; now()&#10;  FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED&#10;),&#10;upd AS (&#10;  UPDATE quota_reservation r SET state = &#39;EXPIRED&#39;&#10;  FROM expired e WHERE r.reservation_id = e.reservation_id&#10;  RETURNING e.quota_key, e.qty&#10;)&#10;UPDATE quota_counter c&#10;   SET used = c.used - u.qty, updated_at = now()&#10;  FROM (SELECT quota_key, SUM(qty) AS qty FROM upd GROUP BY quota_key) u&#10; WHERE c.quota_key = u.quota_key;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expired </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reservation_id, quota_key, qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_reservation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'HELD'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expires_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SKIP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LOCKED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">upd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_reservation r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EXPIRED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expired e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reservation_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reservation_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  RETURNING </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">quota_key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_counter c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> used </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">used</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_key, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(qty) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> upd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_key) u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">quota_key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">quota_key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED</code> 让多个回收进程可以并行而不互相阻塞，这对高并发秒杀场景是必要的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与准入求值的边界\">与准入求值的边界</h2><p>配额校验属于<strong>订单级事实</strong>，因此它在矩阵求值里的位置很特殊：矩阵引擎负责产出「这个商品在这个市场受总量配额限制，键为 X」，而<strong>实际的预留动作由配额服务执行</strong>，不由求值函数执行。这个边界不能模糊，原因是求值函数在多关卡被重复调用（发布、详情页、购物车、结算），如果求值本身扣减配额，一次浏览就会消耗额度。</p>\n<p>因此矩阵与配额服务的接口是两段式：求值返回 <code>requires_quota: {key, limit, remaining_snapshot}</code>；下单关卡在确认下单时调用配额服务的 <code>reserve(key, qty, order_id)</code>。<code>remaining_snapshot</code> 仅供展示（「仅剩 3 件」），不能用于判定——判定的唯一依据是预留操作的返回。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;item_id&quot;: &quot;SKU-40218&quot;,&#10;  &quot;market&quot;: &quot;JP&quot;,&#10;  &quot;outcome&quot;: &quot;ALLOW_WITH_CONDITIONS&quot;,&#10;  &quot;quota&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;key&quot;: &quot;JP|electronics-wireless|2026Q4&quot;,&#10;    &quot;limit&quot;: 5000,&#10;    &quot;remaining_snapshot&quot;: 118,&#10;    &quot;enforce_at&quot;: &quot;checkout&quot;,&#10;    &quot;on_exhausted&quot;: &quot;BLOCK&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"item_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SKU-40218\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"JP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"outcome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ALLOW_WITH_CONDITIONS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"quota\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"JP|electronics-wireless|2026Q4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"limit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"remaining_snapshot\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">118</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"enforce_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"checkout\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"on_exhausted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BLOCK\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>enforce_at</code> 明确声明该条件在哪个关卡强制，避免发布关卡误用配额余量去拦截上架。<code>on_exhausted</code> 使耗尽后的行为可配置：多数场景是 <code>BLOCK</code>，个别场景可降级为「转替代市场」，与 <a href=\"destination-block-alt-market\">目的地不可售拦截与替代市场提示</a> 的替代计算衔接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"许可证配额的校验\">许可证配额的校验</h2><p>许可证配额比总量配额多一层约束：额度属于某份许可证。典型场景是进口许可项下的年度额度、受贸易救济措施约束的关税配额额度。这类校验需要<strong>同时验证许可有效性与余额</strong>，且许可失效时余额一并失效。</p>\n<p>药品类管制品是最能说明「资格与额度必须同时生效」的例子：美国《受控物质法》对附表 I 至 V 的物质建立了一套封闭的分销体系，制造与分销必须向 DEA 注册、保存完整准确的库存与交易记录并维持存储安全，附表 I 物质还受生产配额约束且不得开具处方（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Controlled_Substances_Act\">Controlled Substances Act</a>）。注册失效与配额耗尽是两种不同的失败，前者要求整类停售，后者只影响增量，因此两者在矩阵里必须产出不同的原因码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 许可证配额预留：有效期与余额在同一条件更新里校验&#10;UPDATE license_quota q&#10;   SET used = used + :qty&#10;  FROM seller_credential c&#10; WHERE q.credential_id = c.credential_id&#10;   AND q.credential_id = :credential_id&#10;   AND c.verify_status = &#39;verified&#39;&#10;   AND CURRENT_DATE BETWEEN c.valid_from AND c.valid_to&#10;   AND q.used + :qty &lt;= q.limit_value;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 许可证配额预留：有效期与余额在同一条件更新里校验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> license_quota q</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> used </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> used </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seller_credential c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> q</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">credential_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">credential_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> q</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">credential_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :credential_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">verify_status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'verified'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">valid_from</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">valid_to</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> q</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">used</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> q</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">limit_value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>FROM seller_credential</code> 的联结把资格核验拉进了同一个原子操作。若拆成两步（先查资格再扣额度），在资格被吊销的瞬间会放过一笔交易。</p>\n<h3 id=\"配额与限额的语义混淆\">配额与限额的语义混淆</h3><p>一个常见的建模错误是把「单笔限购」与「总量配额」用同一张表表达。前者是每笔订单的上限（<code>qty &lt;= max_per_order</code>），不消耗全局计数；后者消耗全局计数。两者的失败文案也不同：前者提示「单笔最多 N 件」，后者提示「该商品本季度额度已用完」。因此条件记录里必须区分 <code>limit_kind</code>：<code>per_order</code> / <code>per_buyer</code> / <code>global</code> / <code>license</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"降级与一致性权衡\">降级与一致性权衡</h2><p>配额服务是下单链路的关键路径依赖，它不可用时的行为必须预先决定。三种可选策略：<strong>fail-closed</strong>（拒绝下单，保证不超发）、<strong>fail-open</strong>（放行并异步补扣，允许少量超发）、<strong>降级为提示</strong>（放行但不保证额度，事后人工处理）。选择依据是超发的业务后果：法定配额与关税配额必须 fail-closed，营销活动配额可 fail-open。</p>\n<p>一致性上，配额计数不需要强一致到全局唯一时刻——它需要的是<strong>不超发</strong>，而这由单键上的条件更新即可保证。跨键（例如同时受总量配额与单主体配额约束）不需要分布式事务：按固定顺序依次预留，任一失败则回滚已成功的预留，并在回滚失败时记录待补偿条目交由对账修复。这个「依次预留 + 补偿」模式比两阶段提交简单得多，代价是可能出现短暂的中间态，需要用超时回收兜底。</p>\n<h3 id=\"观测什么\">观测什么</h3><p>配额相关的关键观测指标是<strong>预留失败率</strong>（区分「确实耗尽」与「并发冲突重试失败」）、<strong>回收泄漏量</strong>（<code>used</code> 与实际活跃预总之差）、以及<strong>预留到确认的转化率</strong>。第二项是发现回补 bug 的唯一有效信号：若泄漏量随时间单调上升，说明存在回补缺失。</p>\n<h3 id=\"高冲突场景的额外手段\">高冲突场景的额外手段</h3><p>秒杀类活动的冲突概率远高于常规配额，单键条件更新会成为热点行。可行手段有两层：<strong>在单键内批量预留</strong>（一次更新预留多件，减少热点访问次数），以及<strong>把配额预切分到多个分片键</strong>（例如按 <code>market|category|period|shard_id</code> 切成 N 个计数器，请求按哈希落到某个分片，任一分片耗尽才整体耗尽）。分片会让总量控制变成近似——各分片余量不能互相挪用，因此会提前耗尽，需要按经验把分片数设得足够小以控制误差。是否值得引入分片，取决于冲突概率与超发容忍度，不要在低冲突场景预先分片。</p>\n<h3 id=\"幂等-同一订单重复预留\">幂等：同一订单重复预留</h3><p>支付重试会让同一订单发起多次预留。预留接口必须以 <code>order_id</code> 为幂等键：已存在该订单的 <code>HELD</code> 或 <code>CONFIRMED</code> 预留时直接返回原预留号，而不是再扣一次。幂等键要落在唯一约束上，靠数据库而不是靠应用层查一次再插——后者在并发下同样会重复扣减。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>配额型限售的求值不是纯函数，而是一次带预留语义的资源分配；把它当普通条件会导致超卖。</li>\n<li>用条件更新把校验与扣减合并成一条原子 SQL，受影响行数是成功与否的唯一依据。</li>\n<li>采用预留 + 确认/释放模型，<code>used</code> 表示「已预留 + 已确认」，与是否结算解耦。</li>\n<li>过期预留回收必须与状态置位在同一事务，并用 <code>FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED</code> 支持并行回收。</li>\n<li>矩阵只输出「受配额约束 + 键 + 强制关卡」，实际预留由配额服务在下单关卡执行，避免求值副作用。</li>\n<li>许可证配额要把资格有效期拉进同一个条件更新；条件记录须区分 <code>per_order</code>/<code>per_buyer</code>/<code>global</code>/<code>license</code>。</li>\n<li>配额服务不可用时的策略按业务后果选择：法定与关税配额 fail-closed，营销配额可 fail-open。</li>\n<li>跨键预留用「依次预留 + 失败补偿」而非分布式事务，并用泄漏量指标发现回补缺失。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"限售数量/许可证实时校验（联186）","id":"限售数量-许可证实时校验-联186"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"条件更新与预留语义","id":"条件更新与预留语义"},{"level":3,"text":"过期预留的回收","id":"过期预留的回收"},{"level":2,"text":"与准入求值的边界","id":"与准入求值的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"许可证配额的校验","id":"许可证配额的校验"},{"level":3,"text":"配额与限额的语义混淆","id":"配额与限额的语义混淆"},{"level":2,"text":"降级与一致性权衡","id":"降级与一致性权衡"},{"level":3,"text":"观测什么","id":"观测什么"},{"level":3,"text":"高冲突场景的额外手段","id":"高冲突场景的额外手段"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等：同一订单重复预留","id":"幂等-同一订单重复预留"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"目的地不可售拦截与替代市场提示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-market-eligibility-matrix/sellability-gates/destination-block-alt-market"},"next":{"title":"市场开关与分批灰度放量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-market-eligibility-matrix/matrix-rollout-audit/market-switch-phased-rollout"}}